{"unit_id":"MichengAI__dsh-simplify#feature-01","repo":"MichengAI/dsh-simplify","commit":"2dda6f9badc45105222a08ae621cf057afa2b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Simplify 的功能「按 Git 变更范围整理」：/simplify 收集工作区改动行并调用当前 Agent。默认以 HEAD 为基准；没有改动时可回看最近提交，也能使用 --staged、--ref 或文件和目录参数缩小范围。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:13-23","src/command.ts:21-42","src/git.ts:177-223"]}
{"unit_id":"MichengAI__dsh-simplify#feature-02","repo":"MichengAI/dsh-simplify","commit":"2dda6f9badc45105222a08ae621cf057afa2b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Simplify 的功能「纳入未跟踪文件」：默认 Git 工作区范围会将未跟踪文件作为新增内容收集；新增文件按整文件交给 Agent，并受文件数、单文件大小等限制。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/git.ts:187-188","src/git.ts:208-223","src/git.ts:24-26"]}
{"unit_id":"MichengAI__dsh-simplify#feature-03","repo":"MichengAI/dsh-simplify","commit":"2dda6f9badc45105222a08ae621cf057afa2b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Simplify 的功能「解析行级编辑范围」：Git unified diff 被解析为变更行区间，上下文行不会加入授权范围；删除、二进制、过大的文件等会跳过并显示原因。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/git.ts:43-106","src/git.ts:220-239"]}
